<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#f7f7f4"><title>Neighbourhood — Good food. Better conversations.</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/portal.css"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"></head><body class="public-home"><div class="topline">✳ &nbsp; A little more love for local food</div><header class="home-nav"><a class="logo" href="/">n.<span>neighbourhood<small>GOOD FOOD, BETTER CONVERSATIONS</small></span></a><nav><a href="#vendors">Discover</a><a href="#why">Why feedback</a><a href="/vendor/login">Vendor login</a></nav></header><main><section class="home-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE LOCAL FOOD COMMUNITY</span><h1>Good food<br>deserves to be <i>heard.</i></h1><p>Meet the people behind your neighbourhood's favourite food. Explore their stalls, share your experience and help small businesses grow.</p><a class="dark-btn" href="#vendors">Explore local stalls ↗</a></div><div class="home-hero-photo"><img src="/assets/pav-bhaji.jpg" alt="Pav bhaji"><div class="photo-caption"><small>MADE WITH CARE</small><b>Every plate has<br>a person behind it.</b></div></div></section><section class="home-vendors" id="vendors"><div class="section-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">A GOOD PLACE TO START</span><h2>Meet your <i>neighbours.</i></h2></div><p>Small stalls. Big flavour. Discover the local food makers around you.</p></div><div class="home-vendor-grid"><% vendors.forEach(v=>{ %><a class="home-vendor-card" href="/v/<%= v.slug %>"><div class="vendor-cover"><% if(v.slug.includes('ramesh')){ %><img src="/assets/pav-bhaji.jpg" alt="Pav bhaji"> <% } else { %><div class="initial-cover"><%= (v.name||'V').charAt(0) %></div><% } %><span>VIEW STALL ↗</span></div><div class="home-card-body"><small><%= v.category %> · <%= v.menu_count %> MENU ITEMS</small><h3><%= v.name %></h3><p>By <%= v.owner_name||'Local food maker' %></p><div class="card-bottom"><span><%= v.review_count %> customer reviews</span><b><%= v.avg_rating||'—' %> ★</b></div></div></a><% }) %><% if(!vendors.length){ %><div class="empty-home">We're getting the first local vendors ready. Check back soon.</div><% } %></div></section><section class="home-why" id="why"><span class="eyebrow">MORE THAN A STAR RATING</span><h2>Feedback that <i>means something.</i></h2><p>A rating tells a vendor how you felt. Thoughtful feedback helps them understand why — the taste, the service, the wait and the little details that make you return.</p><div class="why-points"><div><b>01 / DISCOVER</b><span>Find a local stall and see what's cooking.</span></div><div><b>02 / SHARE</b><span>Tell the vendor about your real experience.</span></div><div><b>03 / HELP THEM GROW</b><span>Turn customer voices into better local businesses.</span></div></div></section></main><footer class="home-footer"><a class="logo" href="/">n.<span>neighbourhood<small>GOOD FOOD, BETTER CONVERSATIONS</small></span></a><span>Built around real people, not just ratings.</span><a href="/admin/login">Platform admin ↗</a></footer></body></html>
